  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using ViT-L image encoder with avgpool aggregation and weighted fusion in multiprofile multimodal models (config_025) achieves high accuracy (0.6352). This experiment tests replacing the RNA encoder (scvi_n200) with scgpt while keeping other components the same. It isolates the impact of RNA encoder choice, a key design decision, to determine if scgpt could further improve performance. This addresses uncertainty about whether RNA encoder variants matter in high-performing multimodal setups, leveraging prior success to explore a critical component."
